    # /tmp/vsc47063/easybuild/build/RStudioServer/2024.12.0+467/foss-2024a-Java-17-R-4.4.2/rstudio-2024.12.0-467/src/cpp/core/json/JsonRpc.cpp:196:11: error: cannot convert const boost::function<void()> to bool in return
